    "commit": "83d89193c",
    "summary": "Fixed a P2 found in external review of pinned revision 6c1574852: runRound invoked the captured hooks.security as a bare function, losing its `this` receiver, so a method-style hook reading this.reviewKind threw TypeError. Fixed by invoking security.call(hooks, targets, round). Added a receiver-aware regression test (a real method hook reading `this.reviewKind`) that reproduces the exact TypeError without the fix."
  },
